@startuml UC-10-Kelola-Materi
title Sequence Diagram: Kelola Materi (Upload/Edit/Hapus)

actor "Users (Creator)" as User
participant "Halaman Kelola Materi\ndengan Editor Markdown\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/materi\nPUT /api/materi/:id\nDELETE /api/materi/:id" as API
participant "MateriController" as Controller
participant "MateriService\nXPService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Materi,\ntabel Pengguna)" as DB
participant "AWS S3" as S3

== Flow Normal - Tambah Materi Baru ==

User -> UI: Mengakses menu\n"Kelola Materi"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/materi/my-materi
activate API
API -> Controller: getMyMateri()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getMateriByCreator(userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nWHERE idPenulis = '[userId]'\nORDER BY tanggalUnggah DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return daftar materi\nyang pernah dibuat
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data materi
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Menampilkan daftar materi\ndan tombol "Tambah Materi"
User -> UI: Klik "Tambah Materi Baru"
UI --> User: Tampilkan form editor\n(Judul, Konten Markdown,\nUpload File/Gambar)
User -> UI: Mengisi judul materi
User -> UI: Menulis konten Markdown
User -> UI: Menyisipkan file/gambar\n(opsional)
User -> UI: Klik "Preview"
UI -> UI: Render preview markdown
UI --> User: Menampilkan preview
User -> UI: Klik "Simpan"
UI -> UI: Validasi client-side

alt Validasi lokal berhasil
    opt Ada file untuk diupload
        UI -> S3: Upload file/gambar ke S3
        activate S3
        S3 --> UI: Return URL file\nyang sudah diupload
        deactivate S3
        UI -> UI: Replace placeholder\ndi markdown dengan URL S3
    end
    
    UI -> API: POST /api/materi\n{ judulMateri, kontenMarkdown,\nidPenulis, fileUrls: [...] }
    activate API
    API -> Controller: createMateri()
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: saveNewMateri(data)
    activate Service
    Service -> Service: Validasi struktur Markdown\ndan sanitasi konten
    
    alt Markdown valid
        Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        activate DB
        Service -> DB: INSERT INTO Materi\n(judulMateri, kontenMarkdown,\nidPenulis, tanggalUnggah,\nstatus_publik, totalDilihat,\nratingRataRata)\nVALUES ('[judul]', '[konten]',\n'[userId]', NOW(),\ntrue, 0, 0)
        DB --> Service: Return idMateri baru
        Service -> Service: Kalkulasi XP Creator\n(20 XP untuk upload materi)
        Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpCreator = xpCreator + 20,\ntotalXP = totalXP + 20\nWHERE idAkun = '[userId]'
        DB --> Service: UPDATE success
        Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        DB --> Service: Transaction committed
        deactivate DB
        Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nmateriId: X, xpGained: 20 }
        Controller --> API: Response 201 Created
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Materi berhasil ditambahkan!\n+20 XP Creator"
        UI --> User: Redirect ke daftar materi\natau preview materi baru
    else Markdown tidak valid
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Format Markdown\ntidak valid" }
        Controller --> API: Response 400 Bad Request
        API --> UI: Error response
        UI --> User: Tampilkan error,\nmateri tidak disimpan
    end
    
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    
else Validasi client gagal
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error validasi
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Edit Materi ==

User -> UI: Pilih materi dan klik "Edit"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/materi/:id/edit
activate API
API -> Controller: getMateriForEdit(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: checkOwnershipAndGetData(id, userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPenulis = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data materi
deactivate DB

alt User adalah pemilik
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: {...} }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Data materi
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan editor dengan\ndata materi existing
    User -> UI: Mengubah judul/konten
    User -> UI: Klik "Simpan Perubahan"
    UI -> API: PUT /api/materi/:id
    activate API
    API -> Controller: updateMateri(id)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> Service: updateMateri(id, data, userId)
    activate Service
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Materi SET\njudulMateri = '[judul]',\nkontenMarkdown = '[konten]',\ntanggalEdit = NOW()\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPenulis = '[userId]'
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: UPDATE success
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpCreator = xpCreator + 5\n(lebih sedikit untuk edit)
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: XP updated
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, xpGained: 5 }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Response sukses
    deactivate Service
    deactivate Controller
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Materi berhasil diupdate\n+5 XP"
else User bukan pemilik
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Unauthorized" }
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> API: Response 403 Forbidden
    deactivate Controller
    API --> UI: Error
    deactivate API
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error\n"Anda tidak memiliki akses"
end

deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Hapus Materi ==

User -> UI: Pilih materi dan klik "Hapus"
activate UI
UI --> User: Tampilkan konfirmasi\n"Yakin hapus materi?\nData tidak dapat dikembalikan"
User -> UI: Klik "Ya, Hapus"
UI -> API: DELETE /api/materi/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: deleteMateri(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: deleteMateri(id, userId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT fileUrls FROM Materi\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPenulis = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return file URLs
deactivate DB
Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Materi\nWHERE idMateri = '[id]'\nAND idPenulis = '[userId]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: DELETE success
deactivate DB
Service -> S3: Delete files dari S3
activate S3
S3 --> Service: Files deleted
deactivate S3
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Materi berhasil dihapus"
UI -> UI: Update daftar materi
deactivate UI

== Exception: Upload S3 Gagal ==

note over S3
  Jika upload S3 gagal:
  - Tampilkan error
  - Materi tidak disimpan
  - User kembali ke editor
end note

== Exception: Database INSERT Gagal ==

note over DB
  Jika INSERT gagal:
  - ROLLBACK transaction
  - Hapus file dari S3 (rollback)
  - Tampilkan error message
end note

@enduml
